# M4 compares golden stdout/stderr/CSV bytes exactly.
#
# This host has core.autocrlf enabled. Without this file Git would normalize
# CRLF to LF in the index and expand LF back to CRLF on checkout, which
# rewrites the mixed CRLF/LF W3 transcripts and the LF W5 report. Storing the
# working-tree bytes verbatim keeps a fresh clone reproducible.
* -text
